flowchart TD
  A[Official source discovered] --> B[Archive exact bytes]
  B --> C[Hash + metadata]
  C --> D[Structured extraction candidate]
  D --> E[Schema validation]
  E --> F[Semantic diff]
  F --> G[Deterministic invariants]
  G --> H{Ambiguity?}
  H -- yes --> I[UNKNOWN / pending review]
  H -- no --> J[Reviewer approval]
  I --> J
  J --> K[Publish immutable revision]
  K --> L[Impact analysis + affected audits]
